      "side": 1,
      "message": "What are these changes actually doing? As far as the API surface I don\u0027t think this changes anything meaningfully, but I don\u0027t know enough about symbol versioning itself to say with confidence what this does.\n\nWhat are you trying to accomplish here?",
      "revId": "3b215b5573cb89de8f7811497eeaddf989572ab7",
      "serverId": "85c56323-6fa9-3386-8a01-6480fb634889"
    },
    {
      "unresolved": true,
      "key": {
        "uuid": "194f44c5_f4d1a66a",
